                {
                    "id": "ca7bb2d2-62ac-44cd-9279-2a515199d1af",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-16T19:30:31Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T19:30:41Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Defeat Strahd von Zarovich"
                },
                {
                    "id": "9fe06201-4972-4711-8be6-fa5e7530d075",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-16T19:30:45Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T19:31:01Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Put a stake through Strahd's heart"
                }
            ],
            "tags": [],
            "title": "Strahd Must Die!",
            "mouseover": "<strong>Simple as, baby!</strong> Build the bomb, blow up Castle Ravenloft, pull Strahd's coffin from the rubble and stake him!",
            "location": "ravenloft"
        },
        {
            "createdAt": "2026-11-16T19:32:34Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T04:20:02Z",
            "icon": "icons/the-verse-to-curse.png",
            "failedIcon": "icons/the-verse-to-curse-failed.gif",
            "failed": false,
            "completed": false,
            "staged": false,
            "id": "the-verse-to-curse",
            "integrity": 85,
            "objectives": [
                {
                    "id": "887b9051-9bac-40ce-a82e-51199088ea88",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-16T19:33:09Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-17T00:57:23Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Find Strahd's magical verses"
                }
            ],
            "tags": [
                "OPT"
            ],
            "title": "The Verse to Curse",
            "mouseover": "In episode sixteen of <i>The Barovia Bunch</i>, our heroes did a rap battle against Strahd. Strahd won, of course, because his words were hexed with his own <strong>dark magics</strong>. Those words carried his magical signature, and with them, we can—<br>You know what? It doesn't matter how—you've probably stopped reading anyways.<br><strong>TL;DR: We need Strahd's verses to hex the bomb, cutie.</strong> So go get them!",
            "location": "abbey"
        },
        {
            "createdAt": "2026-11-16T20:22:00Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T04:20:04Z",
            "icon": "icons/hells-bells.png",
            "failedIcon": "icons/hells-bells-failed.gif",
            "failed": false,
            "completed": false,
            "staged": false,
            "id": "hell-s-bells",
            "integrity": 75,
            "objectives": [
                {
                    "id": "305748cc-9305-4916-9e2e-a8a8459dfed7",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-16T22:07:35Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-17T00:57:30Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Recover the cursed bell"
                }
            ],
            "tags": [],
            "title": "Hell's Bells",
            "mouseover": "Okay, so, this cave used to be a werewolf lair. Then, after the weird mid-season genre shift, it became a casino/bathhouse for gay furries to “socialize”—and who knows what's happened to it since.<br>But back then, it was home to a <strong>powerful cursed relic</strong> in the proprietor's office: a bell that could turn you into a were-person.<br>That bell will serve perfectly for our bomb's casing—<strong>go track it down!</strong>",
            "location": "werewolf-den"
        },
        {
            "createdAt": "2026-11-16T22:07:51Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T06:23:24Z",
            "icon": "icons/so-many-demonic-pacts.png",
            "failedIcon": "icons/so-many-demonic-pacts-failed.gif",
            "failed": false,
            "completed": false,
            "staged": false,
            "id": "so-many-demonic-pacts",
            "integrity": 88,
            "objectives": [
                {
                    "id": "b91466c4-2629-4d13-8f47-48a6e22e2445",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-16T22:10:49Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T22:10:58Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Go to the Amber Temple"
                },
                {
                    "id": "7f322697-0e73-4ee5-8c27-903236f48e86",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-18T21:40:11Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-18T21:40:34Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Charge up the arcanocrystal"
                }
            ],
            "tags": [],
            "title": "So Many Demonic Pacts",
            "mouseover": "I know when you hear “bomb” you think “explosives”, but arcanodemolition's a little bit more... high-concept.<br>There are <strong>tons of captured Dark Ones</strong> locked inside of the Amber Temple. I've rigged up an arcanocrystal with a daemonological interfetterer—it'll intercept any incoming demonic pacts, deals with devil(s), or any otherwise Faustian transactions for power and charge up the arcanocrystal.<br><strong>The more deals you can make</strong> with those poor schmucks, <strong>the bigger our boom</strong>. And we need a big boom.",
            "location": "amber-temple"
        },
        {
            "createdAt": "2026-11-17T00:25:27Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T06:11:36Z",
            "icon": "icons/depth-charge.png",
            "failedIcon": "icons/depth-charge-failed.gif",
            "failed": false,
            "completed": false,
            "staged": false,
            "id": "depth-charge",
            "integrity": 87,
            "objectives": [
                {
                    "id": "990b3417-68ac-4f86-ba63-22f873eae766",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-17T00:33:54Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-17T00:33:59Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Go to Tser Pools"
                }
            ],
            "tags": [],
            "title": "Depth Charge",
            "mouseover": "If this bomb's as potent as we need it to be, baby, it'll need a hell of an ignition charge to kick off the boom.<br>Maxine retrieved <strong>a relic from the Amber Temple</strong> that should serve us nicely, but she took that thing into Castle Ravenloft with her.<br>Luckily for you, I've tracked it down! Less lucky for you, it's about 300 feet underwater. But I have faith in you, cutie! <strong>Dive down into Tser Pools and retrieve that relic!</strong>",
            "location": "tser-falls"
        },
        {
            "createdAt": "2026-11-16T22:25:32Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T04:20:11Z",
            "icon": "icons/delivery-service.png",
            "failedIcon": "icons/delivery-service-failed.gif",
            "failed": false,
            "completed": false,
            "staged": false,
            "id": "delivery-service",
            "integrity": 83,
            "objectives": [
                {
                    "id": "2563517e-0d05-4cd5-ab49-5c6e6e093687",
                    "createdAt": "2026-11-17T00:21:35Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-11-17T00:21:45Z",
                    "complete": false,
                    "staged": false,
                    "text": "Find the legendary wagon pilot"
                }
            ],
            "tags": [],
            "title": "Delivery Service",
            "mouseover": "Getting the bomb's parts is one thing, baby, but the hardest part will be getting it from here to the castle gates once it's armed—it's much too heavy for the X-Jet and too fragile to just launch at the walls. And even though we're moving pretty quick, nothing happens in the valley without Strahd knowing.<br>We'll need a <strong>ground vehicle</strong>, and ideally <strong>a driver</strong>, so you can focus on fighting off Strahd's fliers.<br>Rumor is, there's a wagon tech and driver amongst the Vistani. <strong>Go conscript them to our cause!</strong>",
            "location": "tser-pool"
        },
        {
            "createdAt": "2026-11-17T01:01:32Z",
